{
  "key": "letter-365-part-02",
  "number": 365,
  "generationId": "01a1e919-e182-7b7b-9d28-c2590ca1bd36",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "And, rebellion is nothing but a continuity of the old.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.0139
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Hence, understand - do not fight.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/12.mp3",
      "start": 4.125011,
      "end": 6.1599770000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "When has anybody attained anything through fighting?",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/13.mp3",
      "start": 7.439456,
      "end": 9.854035999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Except pain? - except defeat?",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/14.mp3",
      "start": 10.994127,
      "end": 13.235873
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Hence, do not escape, but wake up.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/15.mp3",
      "start": 14.454830000000001,
      "end": 16.422268000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "By escaping one has to keep on escaping.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/16.mp3",
      "start": 17.601768999999997,
      "end": 19.74517
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "And then there is no end to that.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/17.mp3",
      "start": 20.964626,
      "end": 22.911497
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Knowing is freedom.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/18.mp3",
      "start": 24.571904999999997,
      "end": 26.017075000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Not the fear, not the anger, not the enmity, not the rebellion.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/19.mp3",
      "start": 27.470975,
      "end": 31.990159000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Only knowing is freedom.",
      "path": "audio/1971-365/20.mp3",
      "start": 33.452313000000004,
      "end": 35.47
    }
  ]
}
